  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a medium bowl, mix together the Rice Krispies, desiccated coconut, and almond flour.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together the coconut cream, egg whites, sugar, vanilla extract, and salt.",
    "Pour the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients and stir until well combined.",
    "Melt the coconut oil in the microwave or on the stovetop.",
    "Add the melted coconut oil to the mixture and stir until smooth.",
    "Pour the mixture into a greased 9-inch springform pan.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the edges are golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool completely before serving.",
    "Dust with cocoa powder before serving."
  ],
